sequenceDiagram
  actor Client
  participant ChannelRouter
  participant ProviderStatus
  participant ConsentPolicy
  participant RouteResult

  rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
    Note over Client,RouteResult: Case 1: SMS not consented, email selected
    Client->>ChannelRouter: Select notification route
    %% EDGE: DEP-01
    ChannelRouter->>ProviderStatus: Check pushAvailable
    ProviderStatus-->>ChannelRouter: Push unavailable
    %% EDGE: DEP-02
    ChannelRouter->>ProviderStatus: Check smsAvailable
    ProviderStatus-->>ChannelRouter: SMS available
    %% EDGE: DEP-03
    ChannelRouter->>ConsentPolicy: Check hasSmsConsent
    ConsentPolicy-->>ChannelRouter: SMS not consented
    %% EDGE: DEP-04
    ChannelRouter->>ProviderStatus: Check emailAvailable
    ProviderStatus-->>ChannelRouter: Email available
    %% EDGE: DEP-05
    ChannelRouter->>RouteResult: Email selected via immediateRoute
    RouteResult-->>Client: Immediate email route
  end

  rect rgb(255, 245, 235)
    Note over Client,RouteResult: Case 2: SMS not permitted, email unavailable
    Client->>ChannelRouter: Select notification route
    ChannelRouter->>ProviderStatus: Check pushAvailable
    ProviderStatus-->>ChannelRouter: Push unavailable
    ChannelRouter->>ProviderStatus: Check smsAvailable
    ProviderStatus-->>ChannelRouter: SMS unavailable, so SMS not permitted
    ChannelRouter->>ProviderStatus: Check emailAvailable
    ProviderStatus-->>ChannelRouter: Email unavailable
    %% EDGE: DEP-06
    ChannelRouter->>RouteResult: Durable queue selected via durableQueueRoute
    RouteResult-->>Client: Durable queued route
  end
